    <string name="interactive_haptic">Haptic Test</string>
    <string name="interactive_display_help">Inspect the static patterns for possible visible issues. Change each pattern yourself. Normal brightness, system bars and screen timeout remain in effect. App colors are not calibrated physical measurements.</string>
    <string name="interactive_touch_help">Touch or drag across this grid. Only contacts inside this app surface count. System navigation areas cannot be tested. Up to ten contact markers are shown; the count includes all reported contacts. Coverage is an observation, not a health score.</string>
    <string name="interactive_sensor_help">Hold the device securely. Slowly tilt it if comfortable, observe changes in light, or gently cover and uncover the proximity area without force. Accelerometer readings include gravity; zero light can be normal. Proximity values and ranges vary by device.</string>
    <string name="interactive_haptic_help">Start the test, then request each 50 ms pulse yourself. At least two seconds between pulses; at most five per minute. System settings may suppress vibration. Only you can confirm whether it was felt.</string>
